// An act's components are its actor, then its recipient, then its `Related to` objects.
Fact a Identified by A
Fact r Identified by R
Fact o Identified by O
Fact seen Identified by a * r * o
Act send Actor a Recipient r Related to o Creates seen(a, r, o) Holds when True.
send(A, R, O).
?seen(A, R, O).
